    <h1>Quote T&amp;C Historical Detail</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>This pages document the Legal Verbiage and T&amp;Cs used today i=
n D365, Globalscape Salesforce and Tripwire Salesforce as of today (9/2025)=
</p>
