6470fa59019ec81df065f&amp;csf=3D1&amp;web=3D1&amp;e=3DLYeXam</a></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 90.0px;">Info from Customer Ops:</p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 90.0px;"><strong>For Offensive Security:</strong><=
/p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 90.0px;">This Quote is subject to the terms and co=
nditions set forth in <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://nam11.safe=
links.protection.outlook.com/?url=3Dhttps%3A%2F%2Fstatic.fortra.com%2Finfra=
structure-protection%2Fpdfs%2FEULA-Offensive-Security-Solutions.pdf&amp;dat=
