=3DWiPS%2FOEQ2MR5Bss%2B11YLH3yXEQvMMd3bwN7w0vfBVV8%3D&amp;reserved=3D0" rel=
=3D"nofollow">www.fortra.com/legal</a></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 60.0px;"></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 30.0px;"><strong>Other Notes:</strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 30.0px;">Some users have permission to add custom =
text for T&amp;Cs in D365 today. Permissions vary by Brand.</p>
<h1 id=3D"QuoteT&amp;CHistoricalDetail-GLOBALSCAPESalesforce"><strong>GLOBA=
LSCAPE Salesforce</strong></h1>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 30.0px;"><strong>Professional Services Clause:</st=
rong></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 60.0px;">If Professional Services are quoted above=
, signature below and/or issuance of a Purchase Order ("PO") with reference=
 to this Quotation by Customer is evidence of Customer's and Globalscape's =
agreement to be bound by this Quotation, Globalscape's Professional Service=
s Terms and Conditions herein, and the provisions of any designated Stateme=
nt(s) of Work and/or exhibits/appendices.</p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 30.0px;"><strong>Master Solutions Agreement:</stro=
ng></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 60.0px;">This Quote is subject to the terms and co=
nditions set forth in the Fortra Master Solutions Agreement and applicable =
Solution Specific Schedule(s) located at <a class=3D"external-link" data-ca=
rd-appearance=3D"inline" href=3D"http://www.fortra.com/legal" rel=3D"nofoll=
ow">http://www.fortra.com/legal</a> .</p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 30.0px;"><strong>ToC-Standard &amp; ToC-Standard (=
Dual Signature):</strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 60.0px;"><strong>Applicable Sales Taxes will be ap=
plied to the invoice.</strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 60.0px;">Customer has caused its &nbsp;authorized =
representative to execute this Quotation. Any executed copy of this Quotati=
on made by reliable means (e.g. photocopy, pdf, facsimile, electronic or di=
gital signature service) is considered an original.</p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 60.0px;"><strong>By selecting the checkbox below, =
Customer represents that a purchase order is NOT required for Customer to p=
rocess this order for payment. If a Customer purchase order is required, Cu=
stomer must submit the purchase order with this signed Quotation.</strong><=
/p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 60.0px;"><strong><u>NO PURCHASE ORDER IS REQUIRED =
TO PROCESS PAYMENT</u></strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 30.0px;"><strong>M&amp;S Notice:</strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 60.0px;">If quote includes maintenance and support=
, the pricing is based off of the start and end dates on the quote. Any cha=
nges to the support dates will result in a price change.Quotes marked as =
=E2=80=9CDraft=E2=80=9D are ineligible for approval and processing.</p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 30.0px;"><strong>Signature Block with Checkbox ( a=
nd-Reseller):</strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 60.0px;">By each party=E2=80=99s signature below, =
each party hereto has caused their duly authorized representative to execut=
e this Quotation. This Quotation may be executed in counterparts, each of w=
hich will be deemed to be an original but all of which together will consti=
tute one and the same instrument.&nbsp; Any executed copy of this Quotation=
 made by reliable means (e.g. photocopy, pdf, facsimile, electronic or digi=
tal signature service) is considered an original.</p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 60.0px;"><strong>By selecting the checkbox below, =
Customer represents that a purchase order is NOT required for Customer to p=
rocess this order for payment. If a Customer purchase order is required, Cu=
stomer must submit the purchase order with this signed Quotation.</strong><=
/p>
<p style=3D"margin-left: 60.0px;"><strong><u>NO PURCHASE ORDER IS REQUIRED =
TO PROCESS PAYMENT</u></strong></p>
<p></p>
<h1 id=3D"QuoteT&amp;CHistoricalDetail-TripwireSalesforce"><strong>Tripwire=
 Salesforce</strong></h1>
<p>For expertise on what T&amp;C is applied when, please consult Tripwire C=
ustomer Ops at <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"mailto:tw-customeroperati=
ons@tripwire.com" rel=3D"nofollow">tw-customeroperations@tripwire.com</a>.<=
/p>
<h3 id=3D"QuoteT&amp;CHistoricalDetail-Standard/EnhancedQuoteTemplates">Sta=
ndard / Enhanced Quote Templates</h3>
<div id=3D"expander-1743736206" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1743736206" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"2d55757a8cc81e5a3aaafca18b62ee2d6ef0ac=
9d2b73cf4998bd8820e6865bfa" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">From the Standard &amp; Enhanced Quote Templates, =
not all T&amp;Cs apply for all quotes:</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1743736206" class=3D"expand-content">
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Terms Apply</strong> -- The products and services listed in this=
 quotation are provided subject to the terms and conditions at <a class=3D"=
external-link" data-card-appearance=3D"inline" href=3D"http://www.fortra.co=
m/legal" rel=3D"nofollow">http://www.fortra.com/legal</a> . Pricing include=
d in this quotation is an offer for the product quantities and term specifi=
ed in this quotation only. Nothing in this quotation will impact pricing fo=
r any other purchases, or renewals for previously purchased products.</p></=
li>
<li>
<p><strong>Purchase Order</strong> -- Purchase Order must reference the Tri=
pwire Quotation number; any additional or conflicting terms in the purchase=
 order are expressly rejected.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Payment Terms</strong> -- Net 153045607590 days subject to credi=
t acceptance by Tripwire, Inc. Products, support, and technical account man=
agement (TAM) services are invoiced on order acceptance.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Hardware Appliance Shipping Terms</strong> -- Hardware appliance=
s are sold FCA Origin (Incoterms 2010); title and risk of loss pass on deli=
very of the appliance to the carrier. Unless the Customer specifies a prefe=
rred carrier in the order, Tripwire will select the method and routing of t=
ransportation. Freight charges and any other fees paid by Tripwire on shipm=
ents to the Customer or additionally incurred as a result of any agreed upo=
n Customer=E2=80=99s specific routing, packaging, labeling, insurance or do=
cumentation instructions, will be invoiced to the Customer, and shall be in=
 addition to the price of goods. Ship date is dependent on inventory lead t=
imes and order backlog. Tripwire will make reasonable efforts to ship withi=
n 30 days of order acceptance, and will provide the estimated ship date on =
request.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Sales Tax</strong> -- Prices above do not include sales, use, an=
d similar transaction based tax. Such tax will be calculated based on the S=
hip-to address on Customer order.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Extended Support and Subscription Terms</strong> -- Tripwire wil=
l offer limited technical support for the extended product quoted herein un=
til the expiration date of the support period you purchased. Tripwire will =
continue to provide the same level of technical support you currently enjoy=
 with the following exceptions:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>If a product defect is found and verified, Tripwire Customer Support wil=
l document and evaluate the defect.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Where a workaround for the issue exists, Tripwire will not provide progr=
ammatic fixes for the Product. Workarounds that may cause performance issue=
s, scalability issues, or are labor intensive for the customer are consider=
ed valid workarounds.</p></li>
<li>
<p>If the issues require functional enhancements to the product, Tripwire w=
ill not provide further enhancements for the Product. This means that Tripw=
ire will not develop additional features and/or functionalities for the Pro=
duct.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Support &amp; Maintenance</strong> -- Includes updates to the ap=
plicable product, telephone support and enhanced email support for designat=
ed Site Administrators in accordance with Tripwire=E2=80=99s Standard Suppo=
rt Policies at <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://www.tripwire.com/=
legal/support-maintenance." rel=3D"nofollow">https://www.tripwire.com/legal=
/support-maintenance.</a></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Support &amp; Maintenance, Subscription and SaaS Service Terms</=
strong> -- All new Support &amp; Maintenance, Subscription and SaaS terms b=
egin on the final day of the month of product shipment.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Support &amp; Maintenance, Subscription and SaaS Service Terms</=
strong> -- All new Support &amp; Maintenance, Subscription and SaaS terms w=
ill begin two weeks post product shipment.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Support &amp; Maintenance, Subscription and SaaS Service Terms</=
strong> -- All new Support &amp; Maintenance, Subscription and SaaS terms w=
ill begin commensurate with product shipment. All new SaaS service terms wi=
ll begin on the day Tripwire provides user credentials and access to the se=
rvice.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Tripwire Connect</strong> -- Customer=E2=80=99s usage of the Tri=
pwire Connect license is limited to the maximum daily indexing volume in Gi=
gabytes as stated on the order. License Violations occur when a Customer ex=
ceeds the maximum daily indexing volume allowed for its license in a 24 hou=
r period. After five license violations in any rolling 30 day period, Custo=
mer data will continue to be indexed, however certain functions such as sea=
rch, scheduled reports and alerts, will be unavailable (=E2=80=9CReset Even=
t=E2=80=9D). Customer must contact Tripwire support when a Reset Event occu=
rs to request a manual reset. Customer is allowed a maximum of three manual=
 resets during any rolling 90 day period. Tripwire is not obligated to prov=
ide a fourth reset and Customer must either reduce its indexing volume or i=
ncrease the size of its license. Tripwire recommends that Customer monitor =
license usage and purchase a license sufficient to support its intended usa=
ge, in order to avoid License Violations and Reset Events.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Coterminous Support and Subscriptions</strong> -- New support an=
d subscriptions included on this quotation are based on a specified term be=
ginning and ending on the dates shown above. If an order is accepted in res=
ponse to this quotation after the start date included above, the term start=
 date will be adjusted to begin on the support start date described in this=
 quotation and end on the end date shown above. The amount billed to the Cu=
stomer will be prorated to reflect this shortened term.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Hardware Refresh</strong> -- All products purchased in response =
to this quote, which are replacement products for existing appliances, will=
 assume the prepaid, unexpired support term of the to-be replaced appliance=
. Upon execution of an order in response to this quote the prepaid support =
services shall be cancelled on the pre-existing appliance and transferred t=
o the newly purchased product. To confirm the intention to transfer support=
, serial numbers of units to be replaced shall be provided to Tripwire at t=
he time of order. If Support from a pre-existing purchase is not being tran=
sferred and Support is being purchased for the refresh products, the next s=
upport renewal, if purchased, will not increase by more than 5% over the an=
nual support unit price charged. Support services purchased for refresh pro=
ducts shall begin upon expiration of the transferred support term, if any. =
In no event shall the quantity of appliances under support or support term =
length increase as a result of this transfer. The support term for applianc=
e purchases which are not replacements will begin upon shipment.</p></li>
<li>
